<title>FINLAND: FINNISH PARL REJECTS SHOP OPENING HRS BILL - RADIO.</title>
<headline>FINNISH PARL REJECTS SHOP OPENING HRS BILL - RADIO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish parliament on Thursday rejected in the decisive third reading a government proposal to liberalise retail stores' opening hours, Finnish radio news reported.</p>
<p>The bill was defeated by 84 votes to 82, the radio news said.</p>
</text>
